      "id": "welcome-message",
      "name": "Send Welcome Message",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "AIPA Telegram Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Extract Message Info').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "📖 AI PA COMMAND REFERENCE\n\n**Main Commands:**\n/briefing - Daily summary (emails, calendar, tasks)\n/email - Unprocessed email summary\n/calendar - Today's schedule\n/tasks - Pending tasks list\n/context - Switch business context\n/help - This message\n\n**Business Contexts:**\n🏢 Woody's Creations - Laser gifts\n🎵 DJ Business - Event DJ services\n💼 BMF Work - Contract work\n🍺 Pub - Future pub management\n👤 Personal - Personal life\n\n**Natural Language:**\nJust chat normally! Examples:\n• \"What's urgent today?\"\n• \"Show me DJ bookings this month\"\n• \"Create task: Call supplier\"\n• \"When is my next meeting?\"\n• \"How many orders this week?\"\n\n**Tips:**\n- Use /briefing every morning\n- Check /email regularly\n- Natural language is powerful!\n\nNeed more help? Just ask!"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1460,
        40
      ],
      "id": "help-message",
      "name": "Send Help Message",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "AIPA Telegram Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Extract Message Info').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "📊 DAILY BRIEFING\n\n🚧 Full briefing system is being set up...\n\nFor now, try these commands:\n/help - See all commands\n/email - Check emails\n/tasks - View tasks\n\nThe complete briefing workflow will include:\n✅ Today's calendar across all businesses\n✅ Unread emails by priority\n✅ Pending tasks\n✅ Business insights\n\nComing soon! 🚀"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1460,
        160
      ],
      "id": "briefing-placeholder",
      "name": "Send Briefing Placeholder",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "AIPA Telegram Bot"
        }
      }
